WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.200
<i>Out of the Chosen Ones,</i>

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:44.160
<i>just Taichi and Yamato were left behind
in the Digital World.</i>

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:49.540
<i>While Sora and the others
were brought back to the real world.</i>

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:56.510
<i>Taichi and Yamato encounter Leomon's army
which fights against Devimon,</i>

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:03.100
<i>and they raid Valvemon that carries
cargo related to the Holy Digimon.</i>

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.900
<i>The identity of the cargo
before them turns out to be...</i>

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.200
Takeru!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.710
Takeru!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.290
Takeru!

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:33.460
Why is Yamato's brother here?

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.340
What now?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:39.840
This power must be...

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.380
Takeru!

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.140
This isn't good! We must escape!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.910
What power...

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.460
What in the world is that?

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.420
THE SEVENTH ONE AWAKENS

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.420
Velgrmon...

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:07.680
The dark beast that is feared
to swallow the dead in ancient legends.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.300
VELGRMON

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:12.690
Even a Digimon as powerful as that
is lending Devimon power...

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.930
Takeru!

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.330
Let's go, Garurumon!

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:31.580
Yeah!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.810
Us too!

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:34.710
Yeah!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.590
Megadramon.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.590
MEGADRAMON

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.060
Jyuoken!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.820
I'll keep this one busy!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.700
You guys follow Velgrmon!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.950
Leomon, thank you.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.390
Let's go!

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:11.350
Yeah!

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.010
Now, come!

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:15.580
Your opponent is me!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.430
Takeru!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:41.610
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.540
Weregarurumon!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:15.430
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.200
Metalgreymon!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.330
Get on, Yamato!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.180
Takeru!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:00.940
Taichi-san.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.980
As I thought, it won't connect.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.480
Koshiro-kun!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.880
Sorry I'm late.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:09.940
Sora-san.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.340
Last night when I came back home,

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>my mom chewed me out.</i>

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.390
My legs might still be numb
from sitting on my knees for so long.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:24.020
We were gone for three whole days
during that crisis after all.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.110
Koshiro-kun, were you okay?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:26.960
What?

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.140
Well...

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.050
My house is, um...

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:38.350
It's from Mimi-chan and Joe Senpai.
They're both running late.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.560
<i>Koshiro-san!</i>

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.460
Tentomon!

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.230
<i>Ah, we finally connected!</i>

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.090
Tentomon?!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:51.150
<i>Sora-san's with you too?! Then...</i>

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.740
Tentomon! Sora-san! Wait just a minute!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.790
Oh! Wait, Koshiro-kun!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.930
Sorry, Tentomon.

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.640
<i>No worries!</i>

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:07.000
<i>So, where are you two at right now?</i>

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:10.180
We're back in our own world.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.070
<i>Huh? Say what?!</i>

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:14.840
We have no clue why though.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.510
But everyone's safe on our side.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.700
<i>Then that's good to hear.</i>

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.140
<i>Our side too, here!</i>

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.540
<i>Sora!</i>

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.020
Piyomon!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.660
<i>What about Joe?</i>

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.290
<i>Mimi's not there?</i>

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.040
Sorry, those two are late.

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.920
<i>Jeez, Mimi!</i>

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.780
<i>Don't worry, they'll come soon.</i>

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.780
Is everyone on the Network side?

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.790
It looks like the first place
we fought at.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.060
Right on, Koshiro-san!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:49.710
When we noticed,
we found ourselves wound up in this place.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.900
<i>It's been like this from earlier.</i>

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:56.800
<i>We had a hard time getting ahold of you.</i>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.160
We were able to prevent Tokyo's crisis,

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.810
but now there are problems occurring
across networks all over the world.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.290
<i>I'll look into it. Leave it to me!</i>

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.940
Yeah, please, Tentomon!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.450
Don't fall behind, Metalgreymon!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:19.740
Yeah!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.590
We can't even get close at this rate,
let alone catch up!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.090
Metalgreymon, I have an idea!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.850
Giga Destroyer!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.670
Kaiser Nail!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.470
Now!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.350
Here we go!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.850
Yamato, match our timings!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.480
Trident Arm!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.780
Go, Yamato!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.160
All right!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.040
Takeru!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:58.670
Yamato!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.370
This won't last for long!

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:09.440
Yamato...

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.710
Yamato, let me do it instead!

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:14.860
No!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.440
Takeru...

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.700
Takeru!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:22.360
It's me! You hear me?!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.450
Takeru!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.950
Takeru!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.180
Wake up!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.310
Takeru!

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:01.320
Takeru...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.610
Takeru!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.780
Takeru!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.960
Yamato...

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.460
Takeru...

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.460
Yamato!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.440
Takeru!

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.650
Yamato!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.250
Takeru!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.500
Yamato!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.240
Yamato...

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.450
Takeru...

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.040
All right! let's go, Yamato!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.540
Let's all escape!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:40.920
Yeah!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.930
Now, let's withdraw!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.700
We'll stall Velgrmon!

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.680
Metalgreymon, your attack once more!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.310
Okay!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.980
Giga Destroyer!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.700
Giga Storm!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.200
Kaiser Nail!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.400
Yamato!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.580
Is everyone okay?!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.710
Yeah!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.060
This is...

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.690
The one attack that crushed Valvemon!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.740
Takeru!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.110
Yamato!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.870
Takeru!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.380
Shoot, we need to escape!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.630
Yamato!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.970
Yamato...

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:03.900
Takeru!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:25.330
Stop it!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.170
What's this light?

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.700
That's...

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.410
That must be the one...

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:45.250
the one we've been looking for
all this time.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.250
The Holy Digimon!

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:52.380
And...

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.660
And Takeru is...

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.550
Ohh! That light must be...

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.300
ANGEMON

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.310
Takeru...

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.860
This light...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.780
It's giving us power!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.710
Giga Storm!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.470
Kaiser Nail!

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.650
So this is the Holy Digimon's power!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.500
The Holy Digimon...

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:24.160
...became... an egg?

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.120
It's a Digitama.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.710
We, Digimon, are all born from it.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:41.720
And when our life ends,
we're reborn as a Digitama again.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:58.610
Huh?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.700
Who... is that?!

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:20.340
So you've unintentionally ended up in
the suited form to steep into darkness.

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:23.970
Now, return to my side.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:27.430
Holy Digimon.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.570
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.570
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:48.240
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:48.240
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.700
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.700
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:56.290
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:56.290
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.790
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.790
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.170
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.170
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.090
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.090
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.260
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.260
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:10.640
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:10.640
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.600
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.600
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.060
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.060
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:25.240
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:25.240
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.450
<i>Kabuterimon.</i>

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>This Digimon evolves from Tentomon,
my partner.</i>

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:38.750
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.920
TYPE: INSECT

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:43.090
<i>The Mega Blaster attack can take out
multiple enemies in one strike!</i>

00:22:41.090 --> 00:22:43.090
SPECIAL MOVE: MEGA BLASTER

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.420
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.590 --> 00:22:49.930
<i>Kabuterimon's head that I always sit on
is hard, but very comfortable to ride!</i>

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>Kabuterimon teaches me jokes
while I'm on there too.</i>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Though I don't understand half of it.</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:00.190
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:04.780
<i>When Taichi sacrifices his body,</i>

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:08.280
<i>a never-before-seen miracle
befalls Metalgreymon!</i>

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:11.910
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Tide-turning Update"</i>

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:14.740
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
